{"title": "Ancient Altar (Balthazar)", "pageid": 56310, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ancient_Altar_(Balthazar)", "categories": ["Environmental objects"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Ancient_Altar_(Shar)\" title=\"Ancient Altar (Shar)\">Ancient Altar (Shar)</a>        </div>      <aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/d/d8/Ancient_Altar_%28Balthazar%29.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Ancient Altar (Balthazar).png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Ancient_Altar_%28Balthazar%29.png/300px-Ancient_Altar_%28Balthazar%29.png.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Ancient_Altar_%28Balthazar%29.png/300px-Ancient_Altar_%28Balthazar%29.png.webp 1x, /w/images/d/d8/Ancient_Altar_%28Balthazar%29.png 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Ancient Altar (Balthazar).png\" width=\"270\" height=\"277\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure></aside>\n<b>Ancient Altar</b> is an environmental object in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>. It is used to access a secret room inside <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>The Ancient Altar is inside <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar%27s_chambers\" title=\"Balthazar's chambers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Balthazar's chambers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar%27s_chambers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Balthazar's chambers\">Balthazar's chambers</a>, which is in <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a>. Interacting with the bookshelf labelled <i>\"Musty Tomes\"</i> inside the chambers highlights the altar and makes it interactive.\n</p><p>Inserting a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heart\" title=\"Heart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Human_Heart_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Human_Heart_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Human_Heart_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Human_Heart_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Human_Heart_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Human_Heart_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Human_Heart_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Human_Heart_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Human_Heart_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heart\" title=\"Heart\">Heart</a> into the altar unlocks Balthazar's secret room behind the bookcase. Several hearts lie around the room. However, various other body part items found throughout the game also suffice, including the heads of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nere\" title=\"Nere\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/Portrait_Nere.png/25px-Portrait_Nere.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/96/Portrait_Nere.png/38px-Portrait_Nere.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/96/Portrait_Nere.png/50px-Portrait_Nere.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nere\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/Portrait_Nere.png/25px-Portrait_Nere.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/96/Portrait_Nere.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nere\" title=\"Nere\">Nere</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/38px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/50px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karlach\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\">Karlach</a>, as well as the hand of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/38px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/50px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_quests\">Related quests</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar%27s_Experiment\" title=\"Balthazar's Experiment\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Balthazar's Experiment\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar%27s_Experiment\" title=\"Balthazar's Experiment\">Balthazar's Experiment</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715024617\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.095 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.099 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4601/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 40030/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15845/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 739/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.023/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1067138/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   91.748      1 -total\n 74.05%   67.941      1 Template:Infobox_creature\n 39.67%   36.393      1 Template:Infobox_creature/internal\n 30.24%  